OL,3,GNEWSAPermit scheme could be introduced
OL,4,Aon city streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parking permit scheme could be
OL,7,Fintroduced on some residential streets
OL,8,Fin Leicester following complaints
OL,9,Fcommuters and workers are taking up
OL,10,Fon-street spaces.
OL,12,FResidents are currently being asked for
OL,13,Ftheir views on the proposal for seven
OL,14,Fstreets off Tudor Road, in West End,
OL,15,Fwhich would affect about 460 homes and
OL,16,Fbusinesses.
OL,18,FThe streets that would be included in
OL,19,Fthe scheme are Clifford Street, Kate
OL,20,FStreet, Rivers Street, Battenberg Road,
OL,21,FEmpire Road, Mantel Road, and Paget
OL,22,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
